OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with a few showers this
OL,7,Fevening. Then the rest of the night
OL,8,Fwill see clear periods and just a few
OL,9,Flight showers. Fresh northwesterly
OL,10,Fwinds across Shetland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FChance of a light shower at
OL,13,Ffirst otherwise dry with a few bright
OL,14,For sunny spells. Light winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCloud
OL,17,Fand rain spreading northeast for a
OL,18,Ftime on Thursday. Bright spells and a
OL,19,Ffew showers on Friday and Saturday,
OL,20,Fbreezy at times.
